[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3092458894","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108756#issuecomment-3092458894","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108756","id":3092458894,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64Uy2O","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-19T17:05:58Z","updated_at":"2025-07-19T17:05:58Z","body":"I don't think there's enough information in the MRP to understand what's going on for sure. My guess is that this is some sort of cyclic dependency (If A uses B, B uses C, and then C uses A, completing the loop) based off trying to skim it, but the collection of included classes isn't really enough for me to say much more due to the missing types and preloads.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3092458894/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094430656","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108756#issuecomment-3094430656","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108756","id":3094430656,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64cUPA","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-20T10:35:45Z","updated_at":"2025-07-20T10:35:45Z","body":"Let me be absolutely clear that, [as the documentation states](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_object.html#class-object-method-get-class), `is_class` would **never** return `\"Player\"` because player is not a built-in class of the engine.\n\nI would also recommend to improve formatting on the text in this issue, as it's is looking a bit garbled?\nAs I'm gathering, in a nutshell, the problem seems to occur when the `is` operator is negated in any way","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094430656/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3100675855","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108756#issuecomment-3100675855","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108756","id":3100675855,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc640I8P","user":{"login":"IphStich","id":5625804,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2MjU4MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5625804?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich","html_url":"https://github.com/IphStich","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IphStich/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-22T03:27:50Z","updated_at":"2025-07-22T03:27:50Z","body":"> Loss of exported properties: Resource instances revert to default values.\n> Script detachment: Resources show as base Resource type in the inspector (losing their script association).\n\nThe problems OP describes sound to me like they might happen if the GDScript compiler encounters a problem that prevents it from completing? I can't imagine any other reason why resources might lose their `@export` properties, or why they would reset to default values. If nothing else, this might be worth looking into?\n\nWould really appreciate a cleaner MRP here though. The MRP provided requires too many classes that aren't included, meaning we have to remove those manually to get anything to work, and it's impossible for us to know if any of these may be contributing to or causing the issue. Would also like to have clear reproduction steps relating to resource `@export` properties.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3100675855/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3209732679","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108756#issuecomment-3209732679","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108756","id":3209732679,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_UKJH","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-21T09:27:55Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T09:27:55Z","body":"Closing due to lack of response, if you provide the requested information this can be reopened ","author_ass